            "review_title": "Review at Ba Con Cuu Cao Thang",
            "review_text": "Bernard Ban-yew Y\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia3 contributions\n0\nGood food but slow and non attentive waiter/waitress\nDec 2018 • Business\nHopefully this is a constructive criticism for the Management. Last night a business associate and I patronized the restaurant. We order the “all you can eat buffet” hotspot. The meat were fresh but the vegetable we ordered never came other than the usual initial basket of vegetable. We kept reminding the waiter and waitress but no response. The management should either computerize the order taking or at least use a paper method so that food served are ticked off or shown still outstanding. Cleanliness: while the meat shaving and grilling enclosure is nice but the cook inside the enclosure do not bother about cleanliness. The place should be very clean and hygienic as it is near the entrance and could be a showcase for advertisement but garbage were on the floor and I even noticed one of the cook was digging his ear for ear wax while waiting for the meat to be sliced by the slicig machine. Disgusting. Conclusion: nice food and environment but customer service slacking and manager need to train the staff to be more responsive and meat cutting area should be a showcase and kept clean at all times. The slicer should be wearing a mouth guard. All the best.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 20, 2018",
