            "review_text": "Ashleyvietnam\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam159 contributions\n0\nBest Mongolian Hot pot in Saigon\nFeb 2016 • Family\nI am telling this is the best Mongolian Hot pot I ever have in my life.\n\nMongolian Hot pot is not to hard to find in Saigon, but this restaurant, they serve the best one.\n\nOnly fresh beef and lamb, all kind of fresh mushroom you know, vegetables and noodle too.\n\nTheir hot pot soup is really good, 4 different kinds and all best.\n\nThe best part is they buffet so you know, all you can it. The staff are very nice too.\n\nBest food, good service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 9, 2016",
